| Run by the boot sequence when this directory is seen in !Boot.Resources. Its
| job is to publish Packages$Dir, which is how PackMan, RiscPkg and RPCEmu's own
| package manager find the database. The directory layout is the RISC OS
| Packaging Project's, so that all three read and write the same one; this file
| is our own.
|
| An existing Packages$Dir is left alone. A second copy of the database found
| later must not take the name from the one the boot sequence already chose.

If "<Packages$Dir>" = "" Then Set Packages$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IconSprites <Obey$Dir>.!Sprites
IfThere <Packages$Dir>.SetVars Then Run <Packages$Dir>.SetVars
